<title>UK: KEXIM sets $500 million 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>KEXIM sets $500 million 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IMPORT-EXPORT BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *15.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+50-53 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. *PUT AT PAR AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) ONE     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE YEAR U.S. TREASURY -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
